   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Implementationcomma Monitoring &amp; Evaluation of the Public Procurment system</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the proposed IDF grant is to strengthen Vietnam&apos;s system for public procurement by providing support to the implementation of the existing procurement frameworkcomma as well as to the Government&apos;s effort to undertake further improvements in a phased manner.  The IDF grant will focus on developing a mechanism for benchmarkingcomma monitoring and evaluating the progress of public procurement reform and the performance and outcomes of the procurement system.  The grant will also assist in the development of a phased plan for introducing further procedural improvements in the procurement framework.</narrative>
  </description>
